# strings.list — encrypted-string manifest
#
# Format: <ENUM_NAME>|<plaintext string>
#
# ENUM_NAME becomes SVC_STR_<ENUM_NAME> at call sites.
# Blank lines + lines starting with # are ignored.
# UTF-8 (no BOM); \n / \r / \t are NOT interpreted — write literals.
#
# Every string here gets XOR-encrypted at build time by
# scripts/gen_str_enc.ps1 into shared/str_enc_generated.h. The runtime
# in shared/str_enc.c decrypts them in-place at DllMain / main() start.
#
# ONLY add strings that would identify this project to a reverse engineer
# looking at `strings dwmapiext.dll`. High-signal only — encrypting
# generic format strings adds size without meaningful RE friction.

# ─── Product identity ────────────────────────────────────────────
PRODUCT_NAME|CloakGPT
INSTALL_DIR_LEAKY|C:\ProgramData\WinAudioSvc
SVCLDB_TOKEN|svcldb
SVCLDB_API_KEY|SVCLDB_API_KEY

# ─── Named event (unique DWM injection fingerprint) ─────────────
SHUTDOWN_EVENT|Global\DwmCompositorShutdownRelease

# ─── Payload init / hook signatures ─────────────────────────────
PAYLOAD_INIT|=== payload init ===
PAYLOAD_READY|=== payload ready ===
HOOKS_INSTALLED|hooks_install: SUCCESS
HOOKS_UNINSTALLED|hooks uninstalled
HANDSHAKE_OK|init_thread: handshake ok
HANDSHAKE_BAD_HEADER|handshake: bad config header magic=%08x ver=%u (expect %08x/%u)
HANDSHAKE_TOKEN_INVALID|handshake: token INVALID - refusing to install hooks
CONFIG_UNAVAIL|config unavailable - payload will be inert
PEB_UNLINKED|peb_unlink: unlinked + spoofed BaseDllName -> %s (pick=%d, avail=%d, loaded=%d%s)
PE_WIPED|pe_wipe: MZ+PE signatures corrupted

# ─── DWM hook function names (leak that we hook the compositor) ──
HOOK_PRESENT|COverlayContext::Present hooked @ %p
HOOK_DDPRESENT|CDDisplayRenderTarget::Present hooked @ %p
HOOK_LEGACY_PRESENT|CLegacyRenderTarget::Present hooked @ %p
HOOK_RC_WINDOW|CWindowNode::RenderContent hooked @ %p (capture stealth)
HOOK_RC_VISUAL|CVisual::RenderContent hooked @ %p (capture stealth)
HOOK_RC_WINDOW_FAIL|CWindowNode::RenderContent hook FAILED s=%d
HOOK_RC_VISUAL_FAIL|CVisual::RenderContent hook FAILED s=%d
HOOK_PN_DD|CDDisplayRenderTarget::PresentNeeded hooked @ %p
HOOK_PN_LEGACY|CLegacyRenderTarget::PresentNeeded hooked @ %p

# ─── AI provider headers (leak our AI integration) ───────────────
AUTH_HEADER_FMT|Authorization: Bearer %s
ANTHROPIC_VERSION|anthropic-version: 2023-06-01
OPENAI_CHAT_URL|https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions
ANTHROPIC_MSG_URL|https://api.anthropic.com/v1/messages
GOOGLE_GEN_URL|https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/models
OPENROUTER_URL|https://openrouter.ai/api/v1/chat/completions

# ─── Model names (leak specific model choices) ───────────────────
MODEL_GEMINI_FLASH_LITE|gemini-2.5-flash-lite
MODEL_GEMINI_PRO|gemini-2.5-pro
MODEL_GEMINI_3_PRO|gemini-3.1-pro-preview
MODEL_GEMINI_3_FLASH|gemini-3.5-flash
MODEL_OPENAI_GPT55|gpt-5.5
MODEL_ANTHROPIC_OPUS|claude-opus-5

# ─── Resolver PDB symbol names (leak dwmcore RE target) ──────────
PDB_CVISUAL_RC|dwmcore!CVisual::RenderContent
PDB_CWNODE_RC|dwmcore!CWindowNode::RenderContent

# ─── User-facing error messages (leak internals) ─────────────────
ERR_INVALID_KEY_HINT|**Invalid API key.** Cycle providers via Ctrl+Shift+Alt+P or add a key at the dashboard.
ERR_RATE_LIMIT|**Rate limited.** Wait a minute or cycle to a cheaper tier with Ctrl+Alt+M.
ERR_MODEL_UNAVAIL|**Model not available.** Cycle tier via Ctrl+Alt+M.
NO_QUESTION|NO_QUESTION_DETECTED

# ─── Sub-check messages ──────────────────────────────────────────
SUBCHK_THREAD_UP|sub_check: thread up (jitter+backoff)
SUBCHK_SELF_UNLOAD|sub_check: SELF-UNLOAD trigger (%s)
SUBCHK_INACTIVE|subscription_inactive
SUBCHK_NET_FAIL|too_many_network_failures

# ─── Rawinput / hotkey signatures ────────────────────────────────
RIN_CLASS|MSDiagEventSink
RIN_REGISTERED|WM_HOTKEY fired slot=%d

# ─── v3.1 injection-primitive log strings (memory-grep smoking guns) ─
# These fire ONCE at inject/teardown, then the transient ring scrubs
# them within ~600 ms -> during a steady-state exam an admin memory grep
# for peb_unlink / pe_wipe / hooks_install / IsOverlayPrevented / MinHook
# comes up EMPTY. Byte-exact with the (formerly raw) call-site literals.
PEB_UNLINK_NOENT|peb_unlink: no LDR entry found for base=%p (scanned=%d) -- nothing to hide via PEB path (manual-map behavior)
PEB_UNLINK_SCAN|peb_unlink: pool scan complete (scanned=%d ldr entries): loaded=[%s] available=[%s]
PEB_UNLINK_EXCEPT|peb_unlink: EXCEPTION -- DLL remains visible
PE_WIPE_EXCEPT|pe_wipe: EXCEPTION during wipe
INIT_HOOKS_FAILED|init_thread: hooks_install FAILED
INIT_PEB_DONE|init_thread: peb_unlink done
INIT_PE_DONE|init_thread: pe_wipe done
HK_DWMCORE_MISSING|hooks_install: dwmcore not loaded
HK_DWMCORE_BASE|dwmcore base=%p
HK_INSTALL_ENTERED|hooks_install: entered
HK_MINHOOK_FAIL|MinHook init failed
HK_INSTALL_SUCCESS|hooks_install: SUCCESS (Phase A: RUNNING)
HK_UNINSTALL_MHUNINIT|hooks_uninstall: MinHook uninitialized
HK_UNINSTALL_IOP_REVERT|hooks_uninstall: IsOverlayPrevented reverted (6 bytes)
HK_UNINSTALLED|hooks uninstalled
IOP_NOT_IN_BLOB|IsOverlayPrevented not in blob -- skipping patch
IOP_VP_FAIL|IsOverlayPrevented VirtualProtect failed GLE=%lu
IOP_PATCHED|IsOverlayPrevented patched @ %p -- RETURNS TRUE (forces DWM out of hardware overlay plane path so our pixels composite ON TOP of DirectComposition apps). Original 6 bytes: %02x %02x %02x %02x %02x %02x
PN1_CAPTURED|PN1: captured CDDisplayRenderTarget pThis
PN2_CAPTURED|PN2: captured CLegacyRenderTarget pThis

# ─── v4.0 iso-desktop input path (2026-09-21) ───────────────────
# Same treatment as v3.1's injection-primitives -- the payload's
# iso-pipe rin_diag() log format strings now encrypt at rest + scrub
# via the transient ring, matching v3 baseline.
ISO_PIPE_HELPER_CONN|iso-pipe: helper connected
ISO_PIPE_HELPER_DISC|iso-pipe: helper disconnected
ISO_PIPE_CREATE_FAIL|iso-pipe: CreateNamedPipe failed %lu
ISO_PIPE_SERVER_ARMED|iso-pipe server + repeat driver ARMED
ISO_PIPE_MOD_UP_FIRE|iso-pipe MODIFIER slot=%d vk=0x%02X mods=(c%d s%d a%d) on-UP-fire
ISO_PIPE_MOD_DN_FIRE|iso-pipe MODIFIER slot=%d vk=0x%02X mods=(c%d s%d a%d) [on-DN, repeat=%d]
ISO_PIPE_MOD_UP_NON_REPEAT|iso-pipe MODIFIER slot=%d vk=0x%02X on-UP-fallback [non-repeat]
ISO_PIPE_MOD_WATCH|iso-pipe MODIFIER slot=%d vk=0x%02X mods=(c%d s%d a%d) [WATCH-ONLY]
ISO_PIPE_MT_FIRE|iso-pipe MULTITAP slot=%d vk=0x%02X count=%u gap=%ums (eff=%ums span=%dms)%s%s
ISO_PIPE_LP_FIRE|iso-pipe LONGPRESS fired slot=%d vk=0x%02X held=%ums
ISO_PIPE_MOUSE_MULTI|iso-pipe MOUSE_MULTI slot=%d mvk=%u
POLL_LP_FIRE|POLL LONGPRESS fired slot=%d vk=0x%02X held=%ums
DESKWATCH_SWITCH_ISO|secure desktop -- iso-pipe carries input
DESKWATCH_SWITCH_DEF|re-homing local input

# ─── v4.0.2 v3-audit extension: high-signal LL/hotkey diag strings ──
# Enrolls remaining rin_diag() format strings that scream 'LL keyboard
# hook + inputsink + poll_thread + hotkey system' at a lazy admin
# `strings` sweep. Same threat model as v3.1 injection primitives.
WH_KEYBOARD_LL_INSTALLED|WH_KEYBOARD_LL installed hook=%p tid=%lu
WH_MOUSE_LL_INSTALLED|WH_MOUSE_LL installed hook=%p (wheel-scroll routing armed)
LL_HOOK_MOD_WATCH|LL_HOOK fired slot=%d vk=0x%02X mods=(c%d s%d a%d) [WATCH-ONLY, pass-through]
LL_HOOK_MOD_CONSUMED|LL_HOOK fired slot=%d vk=0x%02X mods=(c%d s%d a%d) [consumed, repeat=%d]
LL_HOOK_MULTITAP|LL_HOOK MULTITAP fired slot=%d vk=0x%02X count=%u gap=%ums (eff=%ums span=%dms)%s%s
MOUSE_MULTI_FIRED|MOUSE_MULTI fired slot=%d mvk=%u count=%u gap=%ums
MOUSE_HOLD_FIRED|MOUSE_HOLD fired slot=%d mvk=%u held=%ums
RIDEV_INPUTSINK_REG|RIDEV_INPUTSINK registered hwnd=%p tid=%lu
POLL_ALIVE|poll alive polls=%u mods=%u targetVKs=%u nearMatches=%u
REGISTERHOTKEY_FAIL|RegisterHotKey slot=%d vk=0x%02X mod=0x%X FAILED %lu
